# Conformers: CREST search, xTB re-optimisation, DFT refinement.
recipe: conformers
title: Conformers
field: Conformations
summary: CREST conformer search, then xTB, then DFT optimisation and frequencies
description: CREST searches the conformers, xTB re-optimises the structure, and a DFT optimisation with frequencies refines it. One box per conformer pattern is a later addition; this recipe follows the lowest conformer.
role: dft | DFT optimisation and frequencies | B3LYP | 6-31+G(d) | the usual starting level; diffuse functions when the molecule is an anion
rules: anion-diffuse, heavy-ecp, size, registered

variant: orca | CREST, xTB, ORCA | ORCA
step: orca | crest | CREST | | Conformer Search | conformer search | structure
step: orca | xtb | xtb | | GeoVib | xTB Opt + Freq |
step: orca | dft | ORCA | dft | GeoVib | DFT Opt + Freq | key=final, thermo
link: orca | crest | xtb | geometry
link: orca | xtb | dft | geometry

variant: g16 | CREST, xTB, Gaussian 16 | G16
step: g16 | crest | CREST | | Conformer Search | conformer search | structure
step: g16 | xtb | xtb | | GeoVib | xTB Opt + Freq |
step: g16 | dft | G16 | dft | GeoVib | DFT Opt + Freq | key=final, thermo
link: g16 | crest | xtb | geometry
link: g16 | xtb | dft | geometry
